      "content": "1. The updated information changes how many dishes Jada makes, but it does not change the amount of clay needed for each dish.\n2. Each clay dish requires 2 cups of clay.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ cups}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. Rory makes 20 more clay dishes than Kora.",
