      "content": "- Kora makes \\(20\\) dishes.\n- Rory makes \\(20+20=40\\) dishes.\n- Jada makes \\(2\\times40=80\\) dishes.\n- Together:\n\n\\[\n80+40+20=\\boxed{140\\text{ clay dishes}}\n\\]",
